 p.append('</table><p>Full Mac route:571.6s, zero host starvation, output flags or late samples; maximum measured alignment0.324ms. Native arrival and curve also passed without recording. Fresh video-recording attempts failed timing checks on both hosts; preserved in the evidence. Review footage below is separate stored-score replay of the exact fresh score, without invoking Chestnut. Stored Mac samples verified identical, with0.583ms maximum clock error; native stored replay9.90ms. UI frame gaps reached149ms. Existing UI alerts and screen transitions remain visible.</p><details><summary>Replay measurements and preserved capture failures</summary><pre>'+esc(json.dumps(d,indent=2))+'</pre></details>')
